  "files": [
    {
      "path": "index.html",
      "content": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"en\">\n<head>\n  <meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n  <meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\n  <title>Pixel Temperature Converter</title>\n  <link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"style.css\">\n</head>\n<body>\n  <main class=\"card\">\n    <h1>Pixel Temp Converter</h1>\n    <p class=\"formula\">C→F: (x*9/5)+32 &nbsp;|&nbsp; F→C: (x-32)*5/9</p>\n    <label for=\"temperature\">Temperature</label>\n    <input type=\"text\" id=\"temperature\" placeholder=\"e.g. 25\" autocomplete=\"off\">\n    <label for=\"direction\">Direction</label>\n    <select id=\"direction\">\n      <option value=\"c-to-f\">Celsius → Fahrenheit</option>\n      <option value=\"f-to-c\">Fahrenheit → Celsius</option>\n    </select>\n    <button id=\"convert\">Convert</button>\n    <output id=\"result\" aria-live=\"polite\">--</output>\n  </main>\n  <script src=\"script.js\"></script>\n</body>\n</html>",
      "description": ""
    },
    {
      "path": "style.css",
      "content": ":root {\n  --bg: #1a1a2e;\n  --card: #16213e;\n  --accent: #0f3460;\n  --text: #e0e0e0;\n  --highlight: #e94560;\n}\n* { box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0; padding: 0; }\nbody {\n  min-height: 100vh;\n  display: flex;\n  justify-content: center;\n  align-items: center;\n  background: var(--bg);\n  font-family: 'Courier New', monospace;\n  font-size: 16px;\n  color: var(--text);\n  padding: 1rem;\n}\n.card {\n  background: var(--card);\n  border: 3px solid var(--accent);\n  border-radius: 0;\n  padding: 2rem;\n  width: 100%;\n  max-width: 420px;\n  display: flex;\n  flex-direction: column;\n  gap: 1rem;\n  box-shadow: 6px 6px 0 var(--accent);\n}\nh1 {\n  font-size: 1.6rem;\n  text-align: center;\n  color: var(--highlight);\n  letter-spacing: 1px;\n}\n.formula {\n  font-size: 0.85rem;\n  text-align: center;\n  color: #8a8a9e;\n  line-height: 1.4;\n}\nlabel {\n  font-size: 1rem;\n  font-weight: bold;\n  color: var(--text);\n}\ninput, select {\n  font-family: inherit;\n  font-size: 1rem;\n  padding: 0.6rem;\n  background: var(--bg);\n  border: 2px solid var(--accent);\n  color: var(--text);\n  border-radius: 0;\n  width: 100%;\n}\ninput:focus, select:focus, button:focus {\n  outline: 3px solid var(--highlight);\n  outline-offset: 2px;\n}\nbutton {\n  font-family: inherit;\n  font-size: 1.1rem;\n  font-weight: bold;\n  padding: 0.8rem;\n  background: var(--highlight);\n  border: none;\n  color: #fff;\n  cursor: pointer;\n  border-radius: 0;\n  transition: background 0.1s, transform 0.1s;\n}\nbutton:hover { background: #c7364f; }\nbutton:active { transform: translate(2px, 2px); }\n#result {\n  font-size: 1.8rem;\n  text-align: center;\n  padding: 0.8rem;\n  background: var(--bg);\n  border: 2px solid var(--accent);\n  min-height: 3rem;\n  display: flex;\n  align-items: center;\n  justify-content: center;\n  font-weight: bold;\n  color: var(--highlight);\n}\n@media (max-width: 400px) {\n  .card { padding: 1.2rem; }\n  h1 { font-size: 1.3rem; }\n}",
      "description": ""
    },
    {
      "path": "script.js",
      "content": "const tempInput = document.getElementById('temperature');\nconst direction = document.getElementById('direction');\nconst convertBtn = document.getElementById('convert');\nconst result = document.getElementById('result');\n\nfunction convert() {\n  const raw = tempInput.value.trim();\n  const num = parseFloat(raw);\n  if (raw === '' || isNaN(num) || !isFinite(num)) {\n    result.textContent = 'Error';\n    return;\n  }\n  let converted;\n  if (direction.value === 'c-to-f') {\n    converted = num * 9 / 5 + 32;\n  } else {\n    converted = (num - 32) * 5 / 9;\n  }\n  result.textContent = converted.toFixed(2);\n}\n\nconvertBtn.addEventListener('click', convert);\ntempInput.addEventListener('keydown', (e) => {\n  if (e.key === 'Enter') convert();\n});",
      "description": ""
    },
    {
      "path": "README.md",
      "content": "# Pixel Temperature Converter\n\nA retro pixel-style temperature converter built with plain HTML, CSS, and JavaScript. Works fully offline.\n\n## Features\n- Convert Celsius to Fahrenheit and vice versa.\n- Output is a numeric value with exactly two decimal places (no units).\n- Invalid, empty, or non-finite input shows `Error`.\n- Initial output is `--`.\n- Keyboard accessible: labels, focus states, and Enter key support.\n- Responsive layout from 360px wide.\n\n## Formulas\n- Celsius to Fahrenheit: `F = C * 9/5 + 32`\n- Fahrenheit to Celsius: `C = (F - 32) * 5/9`\n\n## Usage\n1. Open `index.html` in any modern browser.\n2. Enter a temperature in the text field.\n3. Select the conversion direction.\n4. Click **Convert** or press Enter.\n5. The result appears below.\n\n## Files\n- `index.html` – structure and controls.\n- `style.css` – pixel-themed styling.\n- `script.js` – conversion logic.\n\nNo external dependencies, storage, or network requests.",
      "description": ""
    }
  ]
